     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRPregnancyHistoryLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRPregnancyHistoryLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRPregnancyHistoryLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-pregnancy-history</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-historique-de-la-grossesse</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.statusCode</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.directSubject[x]</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.code</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.observationDate[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.effectiveTime</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.result</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.entryRelationship:frObservationSurLaGrossesse</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.component</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.entryRelationship:frNaissance</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.derivedFrom[x]</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.hasMember[x]</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-pregnancy-history</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-pregnancy-history-document</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRPregnancyHistoryDocument</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.header.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRPregnancyHistoryDocument.identifier</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRPregnancyHistoryDocument.code</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.observationDate[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRPregnancyHistoryDocument.effective[x]</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.result</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><t